# 🔧 BAGIAN 3: METHODS (Functions)

## 3.1 Buat Laporan Baru

```javascript
// Baris 97-113: Handle buat laporan bulanan
async function handleNewReport() {
  if (isCreatingReport.value) return; // Prevent double click
  isCreatingReport.value = true;
  try {
    const result = await api.createNewReport();
    await loadHistoryData();
    router.push({
      path: "/report",
      query: { periode: result.periodeDisplay, from: "dashboard", newlyCreated: "true" },
    });
  } catch (err) {
    error.value = err.message || "Gagal membuat laporan baru";
  } finally {
    isCreatingReport.value = false;
  }
}
```

**Flow Eksekusi:**
1. User klik tombol "BUAT LAPORAN BULANAN"
2. Function [handleNewReport()](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#94-114) dipanggil
3. Check jika sedang creating (prevent double click)
4. Set `isCreatingReport = true` (tombol jadi loading)
5. Call API [createNewReport()](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/services/api.js#432-615) → API akan:
   - Ambil periode terakhir (misalnya "2025-11")
   - Increment jadi periode baru ("2025-12")
   - Buat data laporan baru dengan struktur default
   - Save ke localStorage
6. Reload history data untuk tampilkan laporan baru
7. **Redirect ke halaman Report** dengan query:
   - `periode`: "12/2025"
   - `from`: "dashboard"
   - `newlyCreated`: "true"
8. Jika error → tampilkan pesan error
9. Finally → set `isCreatingReport = false`

## 3.2 Set Context untuk Modal

```javascript
// Baris 115-123: Set periode yang dipilih
function setSelectedPeriodeContext(row, fallbackPeriode = "") {
  if (row) {
    selectedPeriode.value = row.periode || row.periodeDisplay || fallbackPeriode || "";
    selectedPeriodeKey.value = row.periodeKey || row.original?.periode || row.periode || fallbackPeriode || "";
  } else {
    selectedPeriode.value = fallbackPeriode || "";
    selectedPeriodeKey.value = fallbackPeriode || "";
  }
}
```

**Penjelasan:**
- Function helper untuk set periode yang dipilih
- Digunakan sebelum buka modal
- Mengambil data dari row tabel:
  - `periode` untuk display (contoh: "11/2025")
  - `periodeKey` untuk API call (contoh: "2025-11")

## 3.3 Handle Aksi Tabel

```javascript
// Baris 125-138: Handle aksi cetak, hapus, download
function handleCetak(row) {
  setSelectedPeriodeContext(row);
  showCetakModal.value = true;
} 

function handleHapus(row) {
  setSelectedPeriodeContext(row);
  showHapusModal.value = true;
}

function handleDownload(row) {
  setSelectedPeriodeContext(row);
  showDownloadModal.value = true;
}
```

**Flow:**
1. User klik tombol CETAK/HAPUS/DOWNLOAD di tabel
2. Function dipanggil dengan parameter `row` (data baris yang diklik)
3. [setSelectedPeriodeContext(row)](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#115-124) → set periode yang dipilih
4. Set modal state jadi `true` → modal muncul

## 3.4 Konfirmasi Cetak

```javascript
// Baris 140-157: Proses cetak laporan
async function handleCetakConfirm() {
  if (isPrintingReport.value) return;
  try {
    isPrintingReport.value = true;
    const periode = selectedPeriodeKey.value || selectedPeriode.value;
    if (!periode) {
      throw new Error("Periode laporan tidak ditemukan.");
    }
    const report = await api.getReportByPeriode(periode);
    openReportPrintPreview(report, selectedPeriode.value);
  } catch (err) {
    console.error(err);
    error.value = err.message || "Gagal mencetak laporan";
  } finally {
    isPrintingReport.value = false;
    showCetakModal.value = false;
  }
}
```

**Flow:**
1. User klik tombol "Cetak" di modal
2. Set `isPrintingReport = true` (tombol jadi loading)
3. Ambil periode dari `selectedPeriodeKey`
4. **Call API** [getReportByPeriode(periode)](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/services/api.js#181-265) → return data laporan lengkap
5. **Call util** `openReportPrintPreview(report, periode)` → buka print window
6. Tutup modal
7. Jika error → tampilkan pesan error

## 3.5 Konfirmasi Hapus

```javascript
// Baris 159-171: Proses hapus laporan
async function handleHapusConfirm() {
  if (isDeletingReport.value || !selectedPeriodeKey.value) return;
  try {
    isDeletingReport.value = true;
    await api.deleteReport(selectedPeriodeKey.value);
    showHapusModal.value = false;
    await loadHistoryData();
  } catch (err) {
    error.value = err.message || "Gagal menghapus laporan";
  } finally {
    isDeletingReport.value = false;
  }
}
```

**Flow:**
1. User klik tombol "Hapus" di modal
2. Set `isDeletingReport = true`
3. **Call API** [deleteReport(periode)](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/services/api.js#616-670) → hapus dari localStorage
4. Tutup modal
5. **Reload history data** untuk update tabel (laporan yang dihapus hilang)
6. Jika error → tampilkan pesan error

## 3.6 Konfirmasi Download

```javascript
// Baris 173-191: Proses download Excel
async function handleDownloadConfirm() {
  if (isDownloadingReport.value) return;
  try {
    isDownloadingReport.value = true;
    const periode = selectedPeriodeKey.value || selectedPeriode.value;
    if (!periode) {
      throw new Error("Periode laporan tidak ditemukan.");
    }
    const report = await api.getReportByPeriode(periode);
    const fileName = `laporan-${periode.replace('/', '-')}.xlsx`;
    downloadReportWorkbook(report, fileName);
  } catch (err) {
    console.error(err);
    error.value = err.message || "Gagal mengunduh laporan";
  } finally {
    isDownloadingReport.value = false;
    showDownloadModal.value = false;
  }
}
```

**Flow:**
1. User klik tombol "Download" di modal
2. Set `isDownloadingReport = true`
3. Ambil data laporan dari API
4. Generate nama file: `laporan-2025-11.xlsx`
5. **Call util** `downloadReportWorkbook()` → generate Excel & trigger download
6. Tutup modal

