        {{ option.label }}
      </option>
    </select>
    
    <!-- Dropdown Items Per Page -->
    <select v-model="itemsPerPage">
      <option v-for="option in itemsPerPageOptions" 
              :value="option">
        {{ option }}
      </option>
    </select>
  </div>
</template>
```

**Vue Directives:**
- `@click="handleNewReport"` → Event listener, panggil function saat diklik
- `v-model="statusFilter"` → Two-way binding (UI ↔ State)
  - User pilih "Draft" → `statusFilter.value = "DRAFT"`
  - `statusFilter` berubah → dropdown update
- `v-for="option in statusFilterOptions"` → Loop array, render `<option>` untuk setiap item

## 5.4 Tabel Riwayat - Body

```html
<template #body>
  <!-- Loading State -->
  <div v-if="isLoading">Memuat data...</div>
  
  <!-- Error State -->
  <div v-else-if="error">{{ error }}</div>
  
  <!-- Empty State -->
  <div v-else-if="reportHistoryData.length === 0">
    Tidak ada data laporan
  </div>
  
  <!-- Table -->
  <template v-else-if="reportHistoryData.length > 0">
    <Table :header="tableHeaders" 
           :data="reportHistoryData"
           :customColumns="['status', 'aksi']">
      <!-- Custom slots untuk kolom tertentu -->
    </Table>
    <Pagination @prev="handlePrevPage" 
                @next="handleNextPage" />
  </template>
</template>
```

**Conditional Rendering:**
Vue render salah satu berdasarkan kondisi:
1. Jika `isLoading = true` → tampilkan loading
2. Jika ada `error` → tampilkan error
3. Jika data kosong → tampilkan empty state
4. Jika ada data → tampilkan tabel

**Table Component Props:**
- `:header="tableHeaders"` → Pass array header
- `:data="reportHistoryData"` → Pass array data (computed)
- `:customColumns="['status', 'aksi']"` → Kolom yang pakai custom template

## 5.5 Tabel - Custom Slots

### Slot Status

```html
<template #cell-status="{ row }">
  <div class="flex justify-center">
    <Chip :label="row.status"
          :variant="row.status === 'FINAL' ? 'final' : 
                    row.status === 'APPROVAL' ? 'approval' : 
                    row.status === 'POSTING' ? 'posting' : 'draft'" />
  </div>
</template>
```

**Penjelasan:**
- `#cell-status="{ row }"` → Terima data row dari parent Table
- `Chip` component untuk tampilkan badge
- Variant ditentukan berdasarkan status (conditional logic)

### Slot Aksi

```html
<template #cell-aksi="{ row }">
  <div class="flex gap-3">
    <!-- Tombol Edit -->
    <button v-if="row.actions && row.actions.includes('Edit')"
            @click="handleEdit(row.periode)">
      <span>EDIT</span>
    </button>
    
    <!-- Tombol Cetak -->
    <button v-if="row.actions && row.actions.includes('Cetak')"
            @click="handleCetak(row)">
      <span>CETAK</span>
    </button>
    
    <!-- Tombol Hapus -->
    <button v-if="row.actions && row.actions.includes('Hapus')"
            @click="handleHapus(row)">
      <span>HAPUS</span>
    </button>
    
    <!-- Tombol Download -->
    <button v-if="row.actions && row.actions.includes('download')"
            @click="handleDownload(row)">
      <span>DOWNLOAD</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</template>
```

**Conditional Rendering:**
- `v-if="row.actions.includes('Edit')"` → Tampilkan tombol hanya jika action tersedia
- Setiap row bisa punya action yang berbeda:
  - Row status "DRAFT" → actions: `['Edit', 'Hapus']`
  - Row status "FINAL" → actions: `['Cetak', 'download']`

## 5.6 Pagination Component

```html
<Pagination :currentPage="currentPage"
            :totalPages="totalPages"
            @prev="handlePrevPage"
            @next="handleNextPage" />
```

**Props & Events:**
- `:currentPage` → Pass current page (prop binding)
- `:totalPages` → Pass total pages
- `@prev` → Event listener untuk tombol prev
- `@next` → Event listener untuk tombol next

**Flow:**
1. User klik tombol "Next"
2. `Pagination` emit event `next`
3. `@next="handleNextPage"` trigger
4. `handleNextPage()` dari `usePagination` dipanggil
5. `currentPage++`
6. [loadDataFunction()](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#53-58) dipanggil
7. [loadHistoryData()](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#214-235) dipanggil
8. API fetch data untuk page baru
9. Tabel update dengan data page baru

## 5.7 Modal Cetak

```html
<Dialog :isDialogOpen="showCetakModal"
        @close="showCetakModal = false">
  <template #body>
    <div class="text-center">
      <!-- Icon -->
      <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 rounded-full">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-blue-600">...</svg>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Text -->
      <h2>Cetak Laporan</h2>
      <p>Apakah Anda yakin ingin mencetak laporan periode 
         <strong>{{ selectedPeriode }}</strong>?
      </p>
      
      <!-- Buttons -->
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <Button @click="showCetakModal = false">Batal</Button>
        <Button @click="handleCetakConfirm" 
                :disabled="isPrintingReport">
          {{ isPrintingReport ? "Menyiapkan..." : "Cetak" }}
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
</Dialog>
```

**Data Binding:**
- `:isDialogOpen="showCetakModal"` → Modal muncul jika `true`
- `{{ selectedPeriode }}` → Tampilkan periode yang dipilih
- `:disabled="isPrintingReport"` → Disable tombol saat loading
- `{{ isPrintingReport ? "..." : "..." }}` → Conditional text

**Flow:**
1. `showCetakModal = false` → Modal tersembunyi
2. User klik tombol "CETAK" di tabel → [handleCetak(row)](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#125-129) dipanggil
3. [setSelectedPeriodeContext(row)](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#115-124) → set periode
4. `showCetakModal = true` → Modal muncul
5. User klik "Cetak" → [handleCetakConfirm()](file:///c:/Users/LENOVO/Documents/GitHub/mutasi-data/src/views/dashboard.vue#140-158) dipanggil
6. `isPrintingReport = true` → Tombol jadi "Menyiapkan..."
7. API call → Print window → Modal tutup

